ht)", "full_signature": "private void notifyHeight(final long height)", "class_method_signature": "ElectrumMultiWallet.notifyHeight(final long height)", "testcase": false, "constructor": false}], "file": "stratum-protocol/src/main/java/org/smartwallet/multi/ElectrumMultiWallet.java"}, "focal_method": {"identifier": "handleAddressQueueItem", "parameters": "(StratumMessage item)", "modifiers": "@VisibleForTesting", "return": "void", "body": "@VisibleForTesting\n    void handleAddressQueueItem(StratumMessage item) throws JsonProcessingException {\n        if (item.params.size() < 1) {\n            log.error(\"got address subscription update with no params\");\n            return;\n        }\n        final String address = item.params.get(0).asText();\n        if (address.isEmpty()) {\n            log.error(\"got address subscription update with no address\");\n            return;\n        }\n        JsonNode result = item.result;\n        if (result == null)\n            result = item.params.get(1);\n        if (result.isNull()) {\n            SettableFuture<Integer> future = downloadFutures.get(address);\n            if (future != null && !future.isDone()) {\n                future.set(0);\n            }\n        } else {\n            retrieveAddressHistory(address);\n        }\n    }", "signature": "void handleAddressQueueItem(StratumMessage item)", "full_signature": "@VisibleForTesting void handleAddressQueueItem(StratumMessage item)", "class_method_signature": "ElectrumMultiWallet.handleAddressQueueItem(StratumMessage item)", "testcase": false, "constructor": false, "invocations": ["size", "error", "asText", "get", "isEmpty", "error", "get", "isNull", "get", "isDone", "set", "retrieveAddressHistory"]}, "repository": {"repo_id": 41754174, "url": "https://github.com/devrandom/java-stratum", "language": "Java", "is_fork": false, "fork_count": 10, "stargazer_count": 17, "size": 2307, "license": "licensed"}}